WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:10.800
DocIQ, iMBrace's document reader, selects a model for each synthetic document.

2
00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:18.600
A repeated invoice returns through the same drop zone.

3
00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:33.440
Processing Logs show each document, its type and saved destination.

4
00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:39.120
Invoice records show which items reached the demo destination or need attention.

5
00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:50.880
A clean invoice reaches the demo destination; exceptions wait with visible reasons.

6
00:00:50.880 --> 00:01:02.920
The two-page invoice is held because its purchase order is unknown.

7
00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:11.080
The checks compare the extracted values with the purchase-order list.

8
00:01:11.120 --> 00:01:29.300
An automated test corrects the purchase order and accepts the remaining values.

9
00:01:29.300 --> 00:01:55.300
An automated test records finance decisions through the visible form.

10
00:01:55.300 --> 00:02:34.540
Recorded decisions approve two invoices and reject the mismatched supplier entity.

11
00:02:35.260 --> 00:02:52.740
The corrected invoice passes fresh checks before reaching the demo finance board.

12
00:02:52.740 --> 00:02:59.700
The repeated invoice is marked duplicate, keeping the original posting.
